# The image build only needs images/**, so keep the build context small — without this
# the whole workspace (including node_modules and Playwright artifacts) is uploaded to the
# daemon on every build.
node_modules
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/*.tsbuildinfo
.git
.github
test-results
playwright-report
blob-report
healing-bundles
**/.e2e-kit
examples
packages
compose
scripts
docs

# Explicitly kept: the generated E2E CA certificate, which the PrestaShop image installs
# into its trust store. It is git-ignored but must reach the build context.
!images/prestashop/e2e-ca/e2e-ca.crt
